# Layout ladder, step 7 (plan/20-core-domain/29-layout-ladder.md): the distribution header's ring
# with one injection branch -- the source HS1 and the AHU circuit of m2-distribution-header, the
# second branch and its header taps (N4, N6) left out. HS1 states the one load's 24 kW and `out`.
# The valve is sized: D-122 chooses its Kv on its common-port flow to a drop band, so the ring's
# whole head no longer reaches the rule and the run converges (C-91, closed by measurement).

fluidscript 1
project static plant_01

circuit heating 100
fluid water

HS1     heat_exchanger power=24 kW out.t=60

connections
N1 - HS1 - N3
N5 - N1

N1 node p=250

circuit AHU 101

HE_AHU  load in.t=50 out.t=30 power=24 kW
TV_AHU  three_way_valve
PU_AHU  pump

connections
N3 - TV_AHU.a length=12 dn=25
NM_AHU - TV_AHU.b
TV_AHU.ab - PU_AHU - HE_AHU - NM_AHU
NM_AHU - N5 length=12 dn=25
